+# Aegis — Production Infra & Integration Patch
+
+This patch adds:
+- MinIO deployment for object store (k8s/infra/minio-deployment.yaml) — useful for on-prem or dev; replace with S3 configuration if using cloud.
+- Postgres deployment for MLflow (k8s/infra/postgres-mlflow.yaml).
+- Dev-mode Vault deployment for bootstrapping (k8s/infra/vault-dev.yaml) — replace with HA Vault in prod.
+- encrypt_store integration for AWS KMS + S3 (services/storage/encrypt_store_aws.py).
+- receipt_signer with Vault Transit or AWS KMS backends and Rekor logging (services/signing/receipt_signer.py).
+- Triton conversion helper using TensorRT trtexec (services/triton/convert_to_tensorrt.py).
+- cert-manager issuer & certificate for webhook TLS (k8s/webhooks/cert-manager-issuer.yaml) and updated webhook deployment with HPA/readiness (k8s/webhooks/model-provenance-webhook-deployment.yaml).
+- Gatekeeper enforcement runbook to flip constraints to deny after audit (runbooks/flip_gatekeeper_to_enforce.sh).
+- Milvus restore drill script (services/milvus/restore_drill.sh).
+- Prometheus scrape config and Grafana dashboard scaffold (k8s/prometheus/scrape-config.yaml, grafana/production_dashboard.json).
+- Promotion guard enhanced to query MLflow, emissions and drift (services/promotion/promotion_guard_enhanced.py).
+- RuntimeClass and tooling for edge node provisioning (k8s/runtimeclasses/edge-nodeconfigs.yaml, tools/provision_edge_nodes.sh).
+- Runbook to test webhook HA (runbooks/ha_test_webhook.sh).
+
+Operator notes (actions to perform after applying manifests):
+1) Replace dev Vault with HA Vault (Helm) and configure Transit key for signing.
+2) Provision KMS (AWS/GCP/Azure) and set KMS_KEY_ID; or configure Vault transit backend and set VAULT_TOKEN/VAULT_ADDR.
+3) Create secrets: minio-credentials, mlflow-db, and set GitHub Actions secrets (REGISTRY_URL, COSIGN keys, REKOR_URL).
+4) If using cloud S3, set STORAGE_BACKEND=s3 and configure AWS credentials for the encrypt_store service.
+5) Install cert-manager and then apply k8s/webhooks/cert-manager-issuer.yaml to generate webhook TLS secret; populate ValidatingWebhookConfiguration caBundle with CA cert.
+6) Run Gatekeeper in audit for 48–72h, fix violations, then run runbooks/flip_gatekeeper_to_enforce.sh to set enforcementAction=deny.
+7) Build and publish images referenced in manifests (webhook, triton-build, triton-runtime, drift-detector, morpheus connectors).
+8) Wire Prometheus to use k8s/prometheus/scrape-config and import grafana/production_dashboard.json into Grafana.
+9) Validate encrypt_store by uploading a sample artifact and verifying an encrypted object appears in S3/MinIO.
+10) Validate receipt_signer by signing a payload and checking Rekor (if configured) for an entry.
+
+Security & productionization notes:
+- The Vault deployment here is dev-mode only. Do not use in production.
+- trtexec requires NVIDIA TensorRT and GPU drivers; run conversion on appropriate build agents (DGX).
+- Ensure IAM / KMS permissions are tightly scoped for encryption and signing operations.
+- Replace any "dev" credentials with secrets managed in Vault or cloud secret manager.
